### 1. Регистрация пользователя
# @name register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "john_doe",
  "password": "secret123"
}

@authToken = {{register.response.headers.Authorization}}


### 2. Аутентификация (если не делали регистрацию)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "john_doe",
  "password": "secret123"
}

@authToken = {{login.response.headers.Authorization}}


### 3. Загрузка номера заказа
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/orders
Content-Type: text/plain
Authorization: {{authToken}}

9278923470

### 4. Получение списка заказов
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/orders
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 5. Получение текущего баланса
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/balance
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 6. Списание баллов
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/balance/withdraw
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{authToken}}

{
  "order": "2377225624",
  "sum": 751
}

### 7. Получение истории списаний
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/withdrawals
Authorization: {{authToken}}